a-v-switzerland-quarter-final-fifa-world-cup-2026-5.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/578075183744d206ff0aa03c8eb003e671474870ff6f8282540880bb22b4b16eb877b122ab79d9cce84edcd9cbd23a35bf1bd8e05282e64eac6129c1d2ebb801a5647b6960359dfbfc5540dd84644695590e8ff61e1cdf1fc3eb12669429ed89/argentina-v-switzerland-quarter-final-fifa-world-cup-2026-5.jpg.avif\"/> </figure> <figure> <img alt=\"argentina-v-switzerland-quarter-final-fifa-world-cup-2026-15-5955.jpg\" src=\"https://cdn.tienphong.vn/images/578075183744d206ff0aa03c8eb003e671474870ff6f8282540880bb22b4b16eb877b122ab79d9cce84edcd9cbd23a35bf1bd8e05282e64eac6129c1d2ebb801a5647b6960359dfbfc5540dd8464469522682cdf40db9f06da19e6cae91e8714f0ca7ea95604f1801b5908427e7f00fe/argentina-v-switzerland-quarter-final-fifa-world-cup-2026-15-5955.jpg.avif\"/> </figure>\n</div>  </div></body></html>"}